---
/** 블로그 목록 — 글 없으면 "준비 중" placeholder */
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const posts = (await getCollection("blog", ({ data }) => !data.draft)).sort(
  (a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf(),
);

const fmtDate = (d: Date) =>
  `${d.getFullYear()}.${String(d.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, "0")}.${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2, "0")}`;
---
<BaseLayout title="Blog" description="pizzaClip 소개 글과 사용 팁을 차곡차곡 쌓아갑니다.">
  <section class="section container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Blog</h1>
      <p>피자클립 이야기와 사용 팁을 차곡차곡 쌓아갑니다.</p>
    </header>

    {posts.length === 0 ? (
      <div class="empty">
        <p class="empty__emoji" aria-hidden="true">🍕</p>
        <h2>곧 찾아옵니다</h2>
        <p>첫 번째 글을 굽고 있어요. 조금만 기다려 주세요!</p>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <ul class="post-list">
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <li class="post-card">
            <a href={`/blog/${post.id}`}>
              <time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{fmtDate(post.data.date)}</time>
              <h2>{post.data.title}</h2>
              {post.data.description && <p>{post.data.description}</p>}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    )}
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .empty {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 5rem) 1rem;
    background: var(--color-menu);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
  }
  .empty__emoji { font-size: 3rem; }
  .empty h2 { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .empty p  { margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-ink); }

  .post-list { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .post-card a {
    display: block;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border-w) solid var(--color-menu);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.12s ease;
  }
  .post-card a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .post-card time { font-family: var(--font-en); color: var(--color-point); font-size: var(--fs-small); }
  .post-card h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h3); margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  .post-card p  { margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); }
</style>
